export function controls(f,actions){const pad=new GamepadInput({dispatch:(name,value)=>actions.gamepad?.(name,value),disconnect:()=>actions.padDisconnect?.()});const keys=new Set(),touch={pitch:0,roll:0,yaw:0,brake:false,trim:0};window.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(actions.cheat?.(e)){e.preventDefault();return;}if(['INPUT','SELECT','TEXTAREA'].includes(e.target.tagName))return;if(['ArrowUp','ArrowDown','ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','Space','PageUp','PageDown','End'].includes(e.code))e.preventDefault();keys.add(e.code);if(!e.repeat&&actions.canTrim?.()){if(['PageUp','PageDown','End'].includes(e.code))actions.trimActivity?.();if(e.code==='PageUp'||e.code==='PageDown')f.trim=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(f.trim||0)+(e.code==='PageUp'?.02:-.02)));if(e.code==='End')f.trim=0;}if(!e.repeat)({KeyU:actions.hideControls,KeyO:actions.orbit,KeyV:actions.smoke,KeyJ:actions.gun,KeyK:actions.missile,KeyF:actions.flap,KeyG:actions.gear,KeyH:actions.hook,KeyC:actions.camera,KeyR:actions.restart,Escape:actions.pause,KeyB:actions.center,KeyM:actions.map,KeyX:actions.context})[e.code]?.();});window.addEventListener('keyup',e=>keys.delete(e.code));window.addEventListener('blur',()=>{keys.clear();touch.pitch=touch.roll=touch.yaw=0;touch.brake=false;touch.trim=0;actions.blur();});let stick=document.querySelector('#stick'),knob=stick.firstElementChild,pointer=null;stick.onpointerdown=e=>{pointer=e.pointerId;stick.setPointerCapture(pointer);move(e);};function move(e){if(e.pointerId!==pointer)return;let r=stick.getBoundingClientRect();touch.roll=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(e.clientX-r.left-r.width/2)/45));touch.pitch=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(e.clientY-r.top-r.height/2)/45));knob.style.transform=`translate(${touch.roll*38}px,${touch.pitch*38}px)`;}stick.onpointermove=move;stick.onpointerup=stick.onpointercancel=()=>{pointer=null;touch.roll=touch.pitch=0;knob.style.transform='';};document.querySelector('#slider').oninput=e=>f.throttle=+e.target.value/100;
 for(let[id,key,value]of[['trim-up','trim',1],['trim-down','trim',-1],['wheel-brake','brake',true],['tbrake','brake',true],['tleft','yaw',-1],['tright','yaw',1]]){let b=document.getElementById(id);b.onpointerdown=e=>{b.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);touch[key]=value;if(key==='trim'&&actions.canTrim?.()){actions.trimActivity?.();f.trim=Math.max(-1,Math.min(1,(f.trim||0)+value*.02));}};b.onpointerup=b.onpointercancel=()=>touch[key]=key==='brake'?false:0;}document.querySelector('#tflap').onclick=actions.flap;document.querySelector('#tgear').onclick=actions.gear;document.querySelector('#trim-reset').onclick=()=>{if(actions.canTrim?.()){f.trim=0;actions.trimActivity?.();}};const read=(dt=1/60)=>{const g=pad.poll(dt,actions.padState?.()||{});actions.padLook?.(g.lookX,g.lookY,dt);if((g.trim||g.trimReset||touch.trim||keys.has('PageUp')||keys.has('PageDown')||keys.has('End'))&&actions.canTrim?.())actions.trimActivity?.();return ({trim:(+keys.has('PageUp')-keys.has('PageDown'))||touch.trim||g.trim||0,trimReset:keys.has('End')||g.trimReset,pitch:(+keys.has('ArrowDown')-keys.has('ArrowUp'))||touch.pitch||g.pitch,roll:(+keys.has('ArrowRight')-keys.has('ArrowLeft'))||touch.roll||g.roll,yaw:(+keys.has('KeyE')-keys.has('KeyQ'))||touch.yaw||g.yaw,power:+keys.has('KeyW')-keys.has('KeyS')||g.power,gun:keys.has('KeyJ')||g.gun,missile:keys.has('KeyK'),actionDown:keys.has('KeyX')||g.actionDown,brake:keys.has('Space')||touch.brake||g.brake});};read.releaseTouch=()=>{pointer=null;touch.pitch=touch.roll=touch.yaw=touch.trim=0;touch.brake=false;knob.style.transform='';};read.gamepad=pad;return read;}
